msgid "If the server rejects a password, the application logs the failure and tries a new random password, even in fixed-password mode (up to 3 retries). Random passwords contain uppercase and lowercase letters, digits and symbols. Password values are not logged or saved in reports. Check the report: a fallback password differs from the one entered. Users remain disabled."
